  says, under ALL THREE C1 conventions — the FAITHFUL paper-29
  §4.3 reading (medium) is the HEADLINE and the unit's original
  two are carried as its STRICTER (block) and WEAKER (sum)
  bounds — with C4 on AND off, and with C3 read one-step (pin
  literal) AND full-chain.
